copy in AIU NOTATION/notation/blocktypes. The parser accepts a
type from the file alone. Drawing lives in code: view.rs,
boxview.rs, rich.rs, json.rkt, aiu-text.rkt, make-live.rkt and
the Racket register file. A type is done only when it shows in
aiutd-tutorial.aiu and has a recorded test.
