code start
name: code-content-build-first
language: text
Content, build first
list         items, bullets or numbered
steps        ordered actions of a tutorial or technique
definition   a term and its meaning
example      a worked example
exercise     a task for the reader
space        blank room, printed for hand work
formula      an equation, opaque text
callout      a boxed remark: note, warning, tip
